From 0abd86beaf410612e775f6cfd27098113ed230fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:20:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(mcp): generate the agent tool reference and local
 prompt from the tool table

mcp::catalog reads the live MCP tool table and makes the Markdown tool
reference (camcraft-cli mcp reference, committed at
docs/agents/mcp-tools.md), the compact local-model prompt (camcraft-cli
mcp prompt) and the shared rules that the Prompt-JSON context now starts
with. Thin wrappers for Codex/Antigravity (.agents/skills) and Gemini
(GEMINI.md) point to the guide and the reference. The MCP guide names
the 34 live tools it lacked. mcp_doc_drift pins the reference, the dead
and missing tool names, and the shared rules.

The .claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md gaps fix is held on the issue.

Refs #1947

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
